</mo><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(S) <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>In which case will the particle move in a straight line with a constant velocity?"
